         tb277 has no OAuth2 provider, no token and no `mail oauth2` authorisation. So
         this run could not test oauth2 authentication itself. What it did establish,
         and what needs no provider, is that the oauth2 config command does nothing.
         Whether oauth2 would authenticate given a token is NOT MEASURABLE on this bench.
