awplus(config)# no mail smtpserver tls
awplus(config)# do show mail -> Use TLS gone; SMTP Server / Authentication crammd5 /
                                Username ckmail / Port 11025 all retained
  => STEP 5 PASS: `authentication`, `port` and `tls` do not displace one another. Each one
     survives the others being set and removed. This is a negative result and it is
     reported as one, not as an absence of testing.

